  <item><title>SORLA蛋白上调减轻tau病理：为阿尔茨海默病神经保护提供新靶点 - LongBiosci</title><link>https://longbiosci.com/news/SORLA-Upregulation-Tau-Pathology-Neuroprotection-2026.html</link><description><![CDATA[Science Advances发表研究：上调SORLA蛋白表达可减轻tau磷酸化和播种、恢复突触可塑性、减轻神经胶质过度活化，为阿尔茨海默病神经保护提供新靶点。]]></description><pubDate>Sun, 26 Jul 2026 18:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://longbiosci.com/news/SORLA-Upregulation-Tau-Pathology-Neuroprotection-2026.html</guid></item>
  <item><title>衰老形态调节剂：靶向SASP多通路策略实现健康衰老——Experimental Gerontology 2026 - LongBiosci</title><link>https://longbiosci.com/news/Senomorphic-Agents-Multi-Target-SASP-Healthy-Aging-2026.html</link><description><![CDATA[2026年7月发表于Experimental Gerontology的系统综述，系统梳理衰老形态调节剂（Senomorphic agents）通过调控SASP实现健康衰老的靶点策略与临床转化前景。]]></description><pubDate>Sun, 26 Jul 2026 12:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://longbiosci.com/news/Senomorphic-Agents-Multi-Target-SASP-Healthy-Aging-2026.html</guid></item>
